(7470298, 1186460, 66384, '<td valign="top">What is that pole in the water? Is it important; does it add value to the image? If not, it might be removed, since that is currently the focal point of the image.</td>', 'What is that pole in the water? Is it important; does it add value to the image? If not, it might be removed, since that is currently the focal point of the image.', '2016-08-30 14:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
