(7471243, 1186547, 140305, '<td valign="top">I can''t help but think of "A Walk in the Woods" when I view this photo. Great book, beautiful photo</td>', 'I can''t help but think of "A Walk in the Woods" when I view this photo. Great book, beautiful photo', '2016-09-02 13:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
