(7471246, 1186386, 140305, '<td valign="top">very pretty scene but seems flat, I think a little more contrast really would make it pop (IMHO)</td>', 'very pretty scene but seems flat, I think a little more contrast really would make it pop (IMHO)', '2016-09-02 13:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471247, 1186454, 140305, '<td valign="top">That''s some extreme camping! Beautiful photo.</td>', 'That''s some extreme camping! Beautiful photo.', '2016-09-02 13:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471248, 1186386, 98339, '<td valign="top">Ok, so on one hand I don''t like the haze - on the other one...it''s kind of interesting.  Possibly a bit more contrast and a light pass of High Pass Filter???</td>', 'Ok, so on one hand I don''t like the haze - on the other one...it''s kind of interesting.  Possibly a bit more contrast and a light pass of High Pass Filter???', '2016-09-02 14:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471250, 1186715, 98339, '<td valign="top">Good feather detail and clarity on the eye and beak.  I''m wondering how you got the black background...taken in a National Zoo?  I''ll be curious where this was taken. And I like your crop for this as well...</td>', 'Good feather detail and clarity on the eye and beak.  I''m wondering how you got the black background...taken in a National Zoo?  I''ll be curious where this was taken. And I like your crop for this as well...', '2016-09-02 14:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471251, 1186359, 98339, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately your subject the bird is not in razor sharp focus a higher f-stop and faster speed would get you that end result.  It''s very important to present bird shots with the clearest sharp focus possible...I do like your bokeh background a lot</td>', 'Unfortunately your subject the bird is not in razor sharp focus a higher f-stop and faster speed would get you that end result.  It''s very important to present bird shots with the clearest sharp focus possible...I do like your bokeh background a lot', '2016-09-02 14:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471252, 1186327, 98339, '<td valign="top">Something I''ve been noticing on many of these entries is haze...I know your time of day is good from the shadows and long light on the mountains...if you added more contrast but you''d have to mask the trees out so they don''t loose their detail</td>', 'Something I''ve been noticing on many of these entries is haze...I know your time of day is good from the shadows and long light on the mountains...if you added more contrast but you''d have to mask the trees out so they don''t loose their detail', '2016-09-02 14:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471253, 1186460, 98339, '<td valign="top">This is pretty.  A bit tight with the trees...but pretty none the less</td>', 'This is pretty.  A bit tight with the trees...but pretty none the less', '2016-09-02 14:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471254, 1186719, 98339, '<td valign="top">I like the title and will be interested in where this was taken.  About all that I could add that might improve this is a B&amp;W Silver Efex Layer as a Luminosity Blending Layer  - to add more detail/dimention to your clouds<br/> <br/>here is <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qDrAn9883Ik" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">the basic idea</a>...I just listened to the tutorial and picked up a couple good usable points...</td>', 'I like the title and will be interested in where this was taken.  About all that I could add that might improve this is a B&W Silver Efex Layer as a Luminosity Blending Layer  - to add more detail/dimention to your clouds here is the basic idea...I just listened to the tutorial and picked up a couple good usable points...', '2016-09-02 14:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471255, 1186561, 98339, '<td valign="top">What a cool shot of the Milkyway!!!  So the arch of the Milkyway was going from horizon to horizon right?  I''d really like to talk to you about how you did this.  I''m going to Colorado in a few weeks and hope to give this a whirl on Oct 1st...fingers crossed.</td>', 'What a cool shot of the Milkyway!!!  So the arch of the Milkyway was going from horizon to horizon right?  I''d really like to talk to you about how you did this.  I''m going to Colorado in a few weeks and hope to give this a whirl on Oct 1st...fingers crossed.', '2016-09-02 14:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471256, 1186480, 98339, '<td valign="top">National Zoo?  I just wish the leaf/stem wasn''t over his/her face.  It''s just a little distracting.</td>', 'National Zoo?  I just wish the leaf/stem wasn''t over his/her face.  It''s just a little distracting.', '2016-09-02 15:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471257, 1186337, 98339, '<td valign="top">Just a little heavy handed with the HDR on this...still an appealing photo</td>', 'Just a little heavy handed with the HDR on this...still an appealing photo', '2016-09-02 15:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471258, 1186620, 98339, '<td valign="top">good balance with going from dark shadows to brilliant outdoor sunlight...well done</td>', 'good balance with going from dark shadows to brilliant outdoor sunlight...well done', '2016-09-02 15:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471260, 1186596, 98339, '<td valign="top">a bit tight on the crop (above his/her head) but your soooo lucky to have gotten this shot.  I was in Yellowstone last year and there was a grizzly about 200 yards from the road...he was...JUST out of my reach for my lens...sigh</td>', 'a bit tight on the crop (above his/her head) but your soooo lucky to have gotten this shot.  I was in Yellowstone last year and there was a grizzly about 200 yards from the road...he was...JUST out of my reach for my lens...sigh', '2016-09-02 15:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471261, 1186362, 98339, '<td valign="top">What a magnificent location, but I don''t like the tones that are in this...you have odd colors that aren''t usually there...but it still is a very beautiful place...love the waterfall!!!</td>', 'What a magnificent location, but I don''t like the tones that are in this...you have odd colors that aren''t usually there...but it still is a very beautiful place...love the waterfall!!!', '2016-09-02 15:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471262, 1186659, 98339, '<td valign="top">I kind of like your processing...good choice</td>', 'I kind of like your processing...good choice', '2016-09-02 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471263, 1186709, 98339, '<td valign="top">So the Elk are back at RMNP (or do they ever leave???)  Good capture, nice color tones</td>', 'So the Elk are back at RMNP (or do they ever leave???)  Good capture, nice color tones', '2016-09-02 15:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471264, 1186418, 98339, '<td valign="top">I think that a bit more contrast (with masking to protect the trees) would add a bit more detail back in the background.  One more...nit picky thing..."I" would have cloned out that odd ball cloud in the sky...JMO</td>', 'I think that a bit more contrast (with masking to protect the trees) would add a bit more detail back in the background.  One more...nit picky thing..."I" would have cloned out that odd ball cloud in the sky...JMO', '2016-09-02 15:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471265, 1186341, 98339, '<td valign="top">It seems that you could have taken a half step to the right (step photography) and gotten a clearer picture of the station.  If you wanted to use the tree to add framing then a higher f-stop would do that for you.  Then your leaves would be part of the photo vs being a bit of a distraction to look around...</td>', 'It seems that you could have taken a half step to the right (step photography) and gotten a clearer picture of the station.  If you wanted to use the tree to add framing then a higher f-stop would do that for you.  Then your leaves would be part of the photo vs being a bit of a distraction to look around...', '2016-09-02 15:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471266, 1186513, 98339, '<td valign="top">Definitely on my bucket list...very, very high on that list.  How hard is it to be able to see Aurora Borealis?  Is there a better time of year to view it?  You or one other seem be able to consistantly get shots of this.  What time of year should I plan on visiting?  Love the colors and glow of this</td>', 'Definitely on my bucket list...very, very high on that list.  How hard is it to be able to see Aurora Borealis?  Is there a better time of year to view it?  You or one other seem be able to consistantly get shots of this.  What time of year should I plan on visiting?  Love the colors and glow of this', '2016-09-02 15:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471267, 1186457, 98339, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful location.  It has been added to my bucket list...stunning</td>', 'What a beautiful location.  It has been added to my bucket list...stunning', '2016-09-02 15:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471269, 1186462, 98339, '<td valign="top">Not a whole lot of improvement to be made here...good balance, motion (clouds).  Possibly if I were nit picky a touch more contrast to bring out the richness of the reds/dark''s on the rock</td>', 'Not a whole lot of improvement to be made here...good balance, motion (clouds).  Possibly if I were nit picky a touch more contrast to bring out the richness of the reds/dark''s on the rock', '2016-09-02 15:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471271, 1186656, 98339, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place.  Here in Florida we have all kinds of boardwalks into the swamps/woods.  Always a delight to see other places in the world.<br/> <br/>Well, that''s weird...the comment above does not belong here...LANGDON!!!<br/> <br/>for your photo....<br/> <br/>It''s hard to find a level spot on here wasn''t it.  The boardwalk on the left should be your best spot to level from?  But then your mountain on the right would be off???  Transformation&gt;Perspective/Warp???</td>', 'What an interesting place.  Here in Florida we have all kinds of boardwalks into the swamps/woods.  Always a delight to see other places in the world. Well, that''s weird...the comment above does not belong here...LANGDON!!! for your photo.... It''s hard to find a level spot on here wasn''t it.  The boardwalk on the left should be your best spot to level from?  But then your mountain on the right would be off???  Transformation>Perspective/Warp???', '2016-09-02 15:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471272, 1186657, 98339, '<td valign="top">What an interesting place.  Here in Florida we have all kinds of boardwalks into the swamps/woods.  Always a delight to see other places in the world.</td>', 'What an interesting place.  Here in Florida we have all kinds of boardwalks into the swamps/woods.  Always a delight to see other places in the world.', '2016-09-02 15:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471273, 1186726, 98339, '<td valign="top">First off let me say how beautiful this photo is, I can see 2 things that standout to me to improve on...mind you it''s only what "I" would try to improve on...<br/> <br/>A high pass filter with a mask applied to add more detail into the rocks and here n there in the trees.<br/> <br/>last...In PsCC - by pressing Alt+ the little turned down page on the far lower right side of the panels will give you a little box that you can pick what blending mode you want...choose overlay.  Now turn choose "B" for brush (lower the opacity to 12) with the black color...lightly go over the darkest parts of the mountain...change to white (X) and do a touch on the clouds.  Final step.  Go to Gaussian blur...take it up to about 50-80 pixels...watch what it does (it will smooth and blend the edges).<br/> <br/>these are just a couple suggestions...not intended to be a know it all...just trying to share.</td>', 'First off let me say how beautiful this photo is, I can see 2 things that standout to me to improve on...mind you it''s only what "I" would try to improve on... A high pass filter with a mask applied to add more detail into the rocks and here n there in the trees. last...In PsCC - by pressing Alt+ the little turned down page on the far lower right side of the panels will give you a little box that you can pick what blending mode you want...choose overlay.  Now turn choose "B" for brush (lower the opacity to 12) with the black color...lightly go over the darkest parts of the mountain...change to white (X) and do a touch on the clouds.  Final step.  Go to Gaussian blur...take it up to about 50-80 pixels...watch what it does (it will smooth and blend the edges). these are just a couple suggestions...not intended to be a know it all...just trying to share.', '2016-09-02 15:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7471274, 1186357, 98339, '<td valign="top">What a cool, cool picture.  I love how the tide out makes stripes on the beach.  My only nit pick would be more sharpening/high pass filter (with mask) on the people...they are just a touch soft in the focus.</td>', 'What a cool, cool picture.  I love how the tide out makes stripes on the beach.  My only nit pick would be more sharpening/high pass filter (with mask) on the people...they are just a touch soft in the focus.', '2016-09-02 15:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
