(7472413, 1186366, 98339, '<td valign="top">There was a road on the way to Canyonlands that was called The Devils Backbone.  It was really, really high up (12K???) we had been climbing, n climbing and all of a sudden we were on the ridge...I yelled...SLOW DOWN!!!  It took my breath away...(not to mention a few years...).  Go me you have a bit of detail lost in the shadows (possible masking???)..but this is a magnificent view for sure...</td>', 'There was a road on the way to Canyonlands that was called The Devils Backbone.  It was really, really high up (12K???) we had been climbing, n climbing and all of a sudden we were on the ridge...I yelled...SLOW DOWN!!!  It took my breath away...(not to mention a few years...).  Go me you have a bit of detail lost in the shadows (possible masking???)..but this is a magnificent view for sure...', '2016-09-05 20:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
