(7472683, 1186638, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> Alex, next time you come to the Isle of Skye you have to pop in and have a wee dram. And tell me how you manage to get this image the way you did. I see this place every day but can''t remember seeing it as beautiful as this. Stunning image. Congrats on the Blue! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hey man, next month I''ll be there, so keep a few beers in the fridge :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Alex, next time you come to the Isle of Skye you have to pop in and have a wee dram. And tell me how you manage to get this image the way you did. I see this place every day but can''t remember seeing it as beautiful as this. Stunning image. Congrats on the Blue!   Hey man, next month I''ll be there, so keep a few beers in the fridge :)', '2016-09-06 03:16:27.000000', NULL, 0),
