(7472688, 1186610, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Paul:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, brilliantly made. This is the Blue for me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If only Paul... If only :D<br/>A lot of GREAT entries in this challenge.<br/> <br/>It''s like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63218" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">pixelpig</a> said: we life in such a wonderful planet, we should do WAY more to save it. This is why Salgado is one of my favourite authors.<br/> <br/>Thank for your appreciation!</td>', 'Originally posted by Paul: Wow, brilliantly made. This is the Blue for me.   If only Paul... If only :DA lot of GREAT entries in this challenge. It''s like  pixelpig said: we life in such a wonderful planet, we should do WAY more to save it. This is why Salgado is one of my favourite authors. Thank for your appreciation!', '2016-09-06 04:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
