(7472694, 1186610, 172697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> I would really like to know where this is...it would probably take 2 oxygen tanks and a few cranes to get me to this spot.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wrong!<br/>Janine, if you''ll ever come in Italy, in the Dolomites National Park, this place is in Sospirolo (provincr of Belluno, in Veneto).<br/> <br/>It''s called "Mis Artificial Lake" and it''s located right after the beginning of the park, a few miles off the city of Belluno.<br/> <br/>You can park right there and reach the lake with a 1 minute walk!<br/> <br/>I''ll post a few more photos for you to see what a beautiful place this is!</td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: I would really like to know where this is...it would probably take 2 oxygen tanks and a few cranes to get me to this spot..   Wrong!Janine, if you''ll ever come in Italy, in the Dolomites National Park, this place is in Sospirolo (provincr of Belluno, in Veneto). It''s called "Mis Artificial Lake" and it''s located right after the beginning of the park, a few miles off the city of Belluno. You can park right there and reach the lake with a 1 minute walk! I''ll post a few more photos for you to see what a beautiful place this is!', '2016-09-06 06:12:01.000000', NULL, 0),
